# Plan mode: request a feature, send it back for a change, then approve the
# revised plan and check the resulting code still passes tests.
@real
@size 140x45
@fixture qa/fixtures/real/wf-plan-feedback
@args --permission-mode plan
WAITFOR /describe a task/ 30
SHOT ready
SEND Add a Complete(i int) error method to List that marks item i done, returning ErrOutOfRange for a bad index.
WAITFOR /Would you like to proceed\?/ 180
SHOT plan-first
KEY 3
TYPE Also add a CountDone() int method that returns how many items are done, and cover it with a test.
KEY enter
WAITFOR /Would you like to proceed\?/ 180
SHOT plan-revised
KEY 1
IDLE 300
SHOT after-apply
RUN cd {PROJ} && go build ./... && go test ./...
